  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Development for Smart Maintenance Technologies of Bridges under Roads and Highways Department in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to improving public safety, quality of life and national competitiveness through precise safety diagnosis of deteriorated bridges in Bangladesh, repair and reinforcement, and establishing an integrated bridge maintenance center.&#xc2a4;&#xb9c8;&#xd2b8; &#xae30;&#xc220;&#xc744; &#xd65c;&#xc6a9;&#xd55c; &#xad50;&#xb7c9; &#xc720;&#xc9c0;&#xad00;&#xb9ac;&#xb85c; &#xad50;&#xb7c9; &#xc548;&#xc804;&#xc131; &#xac1c;&#xc120;, &#xb3c4;&#xb85c;&#xccad; &#xacf5;&#xbb34;&#xc6d0;&#xc758; &#xad50;&#xb7c9; &#xc720;&#xc9c0;&#xad00;&#xb9ac;&#xae30;&#xc220; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9;&#xac15;&#xd654;&#xb85c; &#xad50;&#xb7c9; &#xc548;&#xc804;&#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xccb4;&#xacc4; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase in the number of bridges with improved safety ratings and increase in bridge maintenance efficiency to extend the life of bridges and reduce collapse accidents. Improve the bridge safety diagnosis and maintenance capabilities of Roads and Highways Department of Bangladesh</narrative>
  </description>
